Hi,

It has been a while since my key was added to kernel.org pgpkeys.

Could you please update it? I'm enclosing an export file with it.

Btw, right now, I'm using gitolite authentication via a ssh key you provided.

I added a gpg subkey for authentication. Is it possible to use both
the gpg and the .ssh key?

My plan is to test the gpg authentication together with the fido
card, but I don't want to mess with my .ssh key - at least not until
I test that the authentication will work properly via gpg.

So, my intention is to have both enabled for at least one kernel
release cycle.

Thanks,
Mauro

